  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "A banner-bound horse culture that prizes sworn freedom within inherited law.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Tavraki range the dry grass sea in ordered clan trains, following ancestral routes and ancient grazing law. Their chiefs are constrained by oath circles and the judgment of standard-priests, so even the proudest rider is never wholly above custom. They admire boldness, but only when yoked to discipline, and they remember both hospitality and insult for generations."
